#: ../../source/data.rst:10
msgid "Data Model"
msgstr "数据模型"

#: ../../source/data.rst:12
msgid ""
"cuTile is an array-based programming model. The fundamental data "
"structure is the multidimensional array whose elements share a single "
"homogeneous type. cuTile Python exposes only arrays, not pointers."
msgstr ""
"cuTile 是一种基于数组的编程模型。其最基本的数据结构是元素具有单一齐次类型的多维数组。cuTile Python "
"仅暴露数组抽象，而不直接暴露指针。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:16
msgid "An array-based model was chosen because:"
msgstr "选择基于数组的编程模型基于以下考量："

#: ../../source/data.rst:18
msgid ""
"Arrays know their bounds, so accesses can be checked for safety and "
"correctness."
msgstr "数组自身携带边界信息，因此可以对访问进行安全性和正确性检查。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:19
msgid ""
"Array-based load/store operations can be efficiently lowered to speed-of-"
"light hardware mechanisms."
msgstr "基于数组的 load/store 操作可以高效地降级（lower）为接近硬件极限速度的底层硬件机制。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:20
msgid ""
"Python programmers are already familiar with array-based frameworks such "
"as NumPy."
msgstr "Python 开发者早已熟悉诸如 NumPy 等基于数组的编程框架。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:21
msgid "Pointers are not a natural fit for Python."
msgstr "指针概念并不符合 Python 的语言习惯。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:23
msgid ""
"Within |tile code|, only the types described in this section are "
"supported."
msgstr "在 |tile code| 中，仅支持本节所描述的数据类型。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:29
msgid "Global Arrays"
msgstr "全局数组"

#: ../../source/data.rst:31
msgid ""
"A *global array* (or *array*) is a container of elements of a specific "
"|dtype| arranged in a logical multidimensional space."
msgstr "*全局数组* （或简称为 *数组*）是按逻辑多维空间组织、且具有特定 |dtype| 的元素容器。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:34
msgid ""
"An array's *shape* is a tuple of integers, each denoting the length of "
"the corresponding dimension. The length of the shape tuple equals the "
"array's number of dimensions, and the product of its values equals the "
"total number of logical elements in the array."
msgstr "数组的 *形状（shape）* 是一个整数元组，每个整数表示对应维度的长度。形状元组的长度等于数组的维度数，各元素之积等于数组中逻辑元素的总数量。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:39
msgid ""
"Arrays are stored in global memory using a *strided memory layout*: in "
"addition to a shape, each array has an equally sized tuple of *strides* "
"that maps logical indices to physical memory locations. For example, for "
"a 3-dimensional `float32` array with strides `(s1, s2, s3)`, the memory "
"address of the element at index `(i1, i2, i3)` is:"
msgstr ""
"数组在全局内存中采用 *跨步内存布局（strided memory layout）* 存储：除形状外，每个数组还带有一个同等长度的 "
"*步长（strides）* 元组，用于将逻辑索引映射到物理内存位置。例如，对于步长为 ``(s1, s2, s3)`` 的三维 "
"``float32`` 数组，索引 ``(i1, i2, i3)`` 处元素的内存地址为："

#: ../../source/data.rst:48
msgid ""
"where ``base_addr`` is the base address of the array and ``4`` is the "
"byte size of a ``float32`` element."
msgstr "其中 ``base_addr`` 为数组的基地址， ``4`` 为每个 ``float32`` 元素的字节大小。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:51
msgid ""
"New arrays can only be allocated by the host and passed to the tile "
"kernel as arguments. |Tile code| can only create new views of existing "
"arrays, for example via :meth:`Array.slice`. As in Python, assigning an "
"array to another variable does not copy the underlying data but creates "
"another reference to the same array."
msgstr ""
"新数组只能由主机端分配并作为参数传递给 Tile 内核。|Tile code| 只能基于已有数组创建新视图（例如通过 "
":meth:`Array.slice` ）。与常规 Python 一样，将数组赋值给另一个变量不会复制底层数据，而是创建指向同一数组的另一个引用。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:56
msgid ""
"Any object that implements the |DLPack| interface or the |CUDA Array "
"Interface| can be passed as a kernel argument --- for example, |CuPy| "
"arrays and |PyTorch| tensors."
msgstr ""
"任何实现了 |DLPack| 接口或 |CUDA Array Interface| 的对象都可以作为内核参数传入——例如 |CuPy| 数组和 "
"|PyTorch| 张量。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:59
msgid ""
"When launching from Python with :py:func:`cuda.tile.launch`, distinct "
"array arguments must not overlap in memory, including arrays passed "
"inside tuples. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined. For ahead-of-time "
"compilation, the permitted aliasing is specified by "
":py:class:`cuda.tile.compilation.ArrayConstraint`."
msgstr ""
"从 Python 使用 :py:func:`cuda.tile.launch` "
"启动内核时，不同的数组参数（包括作为元组元素传入的数组）在内存中不得重叠，否则行为未定义。对于预先（AOT）编译，允许的别名关系通过 "
":py:class:`cuda.tile.compilation.ArrayConstraint` 指定。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:64
msgid ""
"An array's shape and strides can be queried with :py:attr:`Array.shape` "
"and :py:attr:`Array.strides`. Their scalar values use ``int32`` by "
"default. For arrays whose shape or stride values exceed the range of "
"``int32``, use :py:data:`cuda.tile.IndexedWithInt64` or set "
"``index_dtype=ct.int64`` in an :py:class:`cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation`."
msgstr ""
"可通过 :py:attr:`Array.shape` 和 :py:attr:`Array.strides` "
"查询数组的形状与步长。它们的标量值默认采用 ``int32`` 类型。如果数组的形状或步长值超出 ``int32`` 的表示范围，请使用 "
":py:data:`cuda.tile.IndexedWithInt64` ，或在 "
":py:class:`cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation` 中设置 ``index_dtype=ct.int64`` 。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:70
msgid ""
"Shape and stride values can be runtime values or compile-time constants. "
"Use ``static_shape_dims`` and ``static_stride_dims`` in "
":py:class:`cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation` to specialize selected dimensions "
"to their launch-time values. The dispatcher can also infer constant "
"dimensions, such as shape or stride values equal to one."
msgstr ""
"形状和步长值既可以是运行时值，也可以是编译期常量。可在 :py:class:`cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation` 中使用 "
"``static_shape_dims`` 和 ``static_stride_dims`` "
"，将指定维度特化为其启动时取值。分发器也能自动推断常量维度（例如等于 1 的形状或步长值）。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:78
msgid ":ref:`cuda.tile.Array class documentation <data-array-cuda-tile-array>`"
msgstr ":ref:`cuda.tile.Array 类文档 <data-array-cuda-tile-array>`"

#: ../../source/data.rst:90
msgid "Tiles and Scalars"
msgstr "Tile 与标量"

#: ../../source/data.rst:91
msgid ""
"A *tile* is an immutable multidimensional collection of elements of a "
"specific |dtype|."
msgstr "*Tile* 是具有特定 |dtype| 的不可变多维元素集合。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:93
msgid ""
"A tile's *shape* is a tuple of integers, each denoting the length of the "
"corresponding dimension. The length of the shape tuple equals the tile's "
"number of dimensions, and the product of its values equals the total "
"number of elements in the tile."
msgstr ""
"Tile 的 *形状（shape）* 是一个整数元组，每个整数表示对应维度的长度。形状元组的长度等于 Tile 的维度数，各元素之积等于 Tile"
" 中元素的总数。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:97
msgid ""
"The shape of a tile must be known at compile time. Each dimension of a "
"tile must be a power of 2."
msgstr "Tile 的形状必须在编译期确定，且每个维度的长度都必须是 2 的幂。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:99
msgid ""
"A tile's dtype and shape can be queried with the ``dtype`` and ``shape`` "
"attributes, respectively. For example, if ``x`` is a `float32` tile, "
"``x.dtype`` returns a compile-time constant equal to "
":py:data:`cuda.tile.float32`."
msgstr ""
"可分别通过 ``dtype`` 和 ``shape`` 属性查询 Tile 的数据类型和形状。例如，若 ``x`` 是一个 ``float32``"
" Tile， ``x.dtype`` 会返回一个等于 :py:data:`cuda.tile.float32` 的编译期常量。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:103
msgid ""
"A zero-dimensional tile is called a *scalar*. A scalar has exactly one "
"element and its shape is the empty tuple `()`. Numeric literals like `7` "
"or `3.14` are treated as constant scalars, i.e. zero-dimensional tiles."
msgstr ""
"零维 Tile 称为 *标量（scalar）* 。标量仅包含一个元素，其形状为空元组 ``()`` 。诸如 ``7`` 或 ``3.14`` "
"之类的数字字面量会被视作常量标量，即零维 Tile。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:107
msgid ""
"Because scalars are tiles, they differ slightly from Python's "
"``int``/``float`` objects. For example, they have ``dtype`` and ``shape``"
" attributes:"
msgstr ""
"由于标量本质上也是 Tile，它们与 Python 原生的 ``int`` / ``float`` 对象略有不同。例如，标量同样具有 "
"``dtype`` 和 ``shape`` 属性："

#: ../../source/data.rst:117
msgid ""
"Tiles can only be used in |tile code|, not in host code. A tile's "
"contents do not necessarily have a physical representation in memory. "
"Tiles are created by loading from |global arrays| using functions such as"
" :py:func:`cuda.tile.load` and :py:func:`cuda.tile.gather`, or with "
"|factory| functions such as :py:func:`cuda.tile.zeros`."
msgstr ""
"Tile 只能在 |tile code| 中使用，而不能在主机代码中使用。Tile 的内容在内存中不一定具有对应的物理存储表示。Tile "
"可通过使用 :py:func:`cuda.tile.load` 、 :py:func:`cuda.tile.gather` 等函数从 "
"|global arrays| 加载创建，或通过 :py:func:`cuda.tile.zeros` 等 |factory| 函数创建。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:123
msgid ""
"Tiles can be stored back into global arrays using functions such as "
":py:func:`cuda.tile.store` and :py:func:`cuda.tile.scatter`."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 :py:func:`cuda.tile.store` 和 :py:func:`cuda.tile.scatter` 等函数将 Tile "
"存回全局数组。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:126
msgid ""
"Scalar constants are |loosely typed| by default, for example, a literal "
"``2`` or a constant attribute like ``Tile.ndim``, ``Tile.shape``, or "
"``Array.ndim``."
msgstr ""
"标量常量默认为 |loosely typed| ，例如字面量 ``2`` 或 ``Tile.ndim`` 、 ``Tile.shape`` 、 "
"``Array.ndim`` 等常量属性。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:130
msgid ":ref:`cuda.tile.Tile class documentation <data-tile-cuda-tile-tile>`"
msgstr ":ref:`cuda.tile.Tile 类文档 <data-tile-cuda-tile-tile>`"

#: ../../source/data.rst:142
msgid "Element & Tile Space"
msgstr "元素空间与 Tile 空间"

#: ../../source/data.rst:156
msgid ""
"The *element space* of an array is the multidimensional space of its "
"elements, stored in memory according to a given layout (row-major, "
"column-major, etc.)."
msgstr "数组的 *元素空间（element space）* 是由其元素构成的多维空间，元素按照给定的内存布局（行优先、列优先等）存储在内存中。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:159
msgid ""
"The *tile space* of an array is the multidimensional space of tiles of a "
"given tile shape within that array. A tile index ``(i, j, ...)`` with "
"shape ``S`` refers to the elements belonging to the ``(i+1)``-th, "
"``(j+1)``-th, ... tile."
msgstr ""
"数组的 *Tile 空间（tile space）* 是指该数组中按给定 Tile 形状划分出的 Tile 多维空间。形状为 ``S`` 的 "
"Tile 索引 ``(i, j, ...)`` 指向第 ``(i+1)`` 、 ``(j+1)`` 、…… 个 Tile 中的元素。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:163
msgid ""
"When accessing array elements via tile indices, the array's "
"multidimensional memory layout is used. To access the tile space with a "
"different layout, use the `order` parameter of load/store operations."
msgstr ""
"通过 Tile 索引访问数组元素时，默认沿用数组自身的多维内存维度顺序。如需按不同维度映射顺序访问 Tile 空间，可使用 load/store "
"操作的 ``order`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:169
msgid "Tiled Views"
msgstr "分块视图"

#: ../../source/data.rst:171
msgid "A *tiled view* represents the |tile space| of a |global array|."
msgstr "*分块视图（tiled view）* 表示一个 |global array| 的 |tile space| 。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:173
msgid ""
"A tiled view's *num_tiles* is a tuple of integers, each denoting the "
"number of tiles along the corresponding dimension. The length of the "
"*num_tiles* tuple equals the tile space's number of dimensions, and the "
"product of its values equals the total number of tiles in the tile space."
msgstr ""
"分块视图的 *num_tiles* 是一个整数元组，每个整数表示沿对应维度的 Tile 数量。*num_tiles* 元组的长度等于 Tile "
"空间的维度数，各元素之积等于 Tile 空间中的 Tile 总数。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:177
msgid "A tile in the tiled view can be loaded or stored by its tile index."
msgstr "分块视图中的每个 Tile 都可通过其 Tile 索引进行加载或存储。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:179
msgid ""
"By default, consecutive tiles along each axis are adjacent with no "
"overlap or gaps: the origin of each successive tile advances by "
"``tile_shape[i]`` elements along axis *i*. Specifying ``traversal_steps``"
" to :meth:`Array.tiled_view` changes the advance per step to "
"``traversal_steps[i]``, producing overlapping tiles when "
"``traversal_steps[i] < tile_shape[i]`` or gapped tiles when "
"``traversal_steps[i] > tile_shape[i]``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，沿每个轴相邻的 Tile 紧邻排列且无重叠或间隔：每步原点沿轴 *i* 前进 ``tile_shape[i]`` 个元素。在 "
":meth:`Array.tiled_view` 中指定 ``traversal_steps`` 可将每步前进量修改为 "
"``traversal_steps[i]`` ：当 ``traversal_steps[i] < tile_shape[i]`` 时产生重叠 "
"Tile，当 ``traversal_steps[i] > tile_shape[i]`` 时产生带间隔的 Tile。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:186
msgid ""
":ref:`cuda.tile.TiledView class documentation <data-tiled-view-cuda-tile-"
"tiled-view>`"
msgstr ":ref:`cuda.tile.TiledView 类文档 <data-tiled-view-cuda-tile-tiled-view>`"

#: ../../source/data.rst:188
msgid ":meth:`Array.tiled_view`"
msgstr ":meth:`Array.tiled_view`"

#: ../../source/data.rst:198
msgid "Shape Broadcasting"
msgstr "形状广播"

#: ../../source/data.rst:200
msgid ""
"*Shape broadcasting* allows |tiles| with different shapes to be combined "
"in arithmetic operations. When an operation involves |tiles| of different"
" shapes, the smaller |tile| is automatically extended to match the larger"
" one, following these rules:"
msgstr ""
"*形状广播（Shape broadcasting）* 允许不同形状的 |tiles| 参与同一算术运算。当运算涉及形状不同的 |tiles| "
"时，较小的 |tile| 会按以下规则自动扩展以匹配较大 Tile 的形状："

#: ../../source/data.rst:204
msgid "|Tiles| are aligned by their trailing dimensions."
msgstr "将两个 |Tiles| 按末尾维度（右对齐）对齐。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:205
msgid ""
"If the corresponding dimensions have the same size or one of them is 1, "
"they are compatible."
msgstr "若对应维度长度相等，或其中之一为 1，则认为该维度兼容。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:206
msgid ""
"If one |tile| has fewer dimensions, its shape is padded with 1s on the "
"left."
msgstr "若其中一个 |tile| 维度数较少，则在其形状左侧补 1。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:208
msgid ""
"Broadcasting follows the same semantics as |NumPy|, keeping code concise "
"and readable while maintaining computational efficiency."
msgstr "广播遵循与 |NumPy| 相同的语义，在保持计算高效性的同时使代码简洁可读。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:214
msgid "Data Types"
msgstr "数据类型"

