"An 8-bit floating-point |numeric dtype| with no sign bit, 8 exponent "
"bits, and 0 mantissa bits."
msgstr "8 位浮点 |numeric dtype| ，无符号位，包含 8 个指数位和 0 个尾数位。"

#: ../../source/generated/includes/numeric_dtypes.rst:89
msgid ""
"A 4-bit floating-point |numeric dtype| with 1 sign bit, 2 exponent bits, "
"and 1 mantissa bit."
msgstr "4 位浮点 |numeric dtype| ，包含 1 个符号位、2 个指数位和 1 个尾数位。"

#: ../../source/generated/includes/numeric_dtypes.rst:94
msgid ""
"An 8-bit floating-point |numeric dtype| with no sign bit, 5 exponent "
"bits, and 3 mantissa bits."
msgstr "8 位浮点 |numeric dtype| ，无符号位，包含 5 个指数位和 3 个尾数位。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:224
msgid "Numeric & Arithmetic Data Types"
msgstr "数值与算术数据类型"

#: ../../source/data.rst:225
msgid ""
"A *numeric* data type represents numbers. An *arithmetic* data type is a "
"numeric data type that supports general arithmetic operations such as "
"addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division."
msgstr "*数值（numeric）* 数据类型用于表示数字；*算术（arithmetic）* 数据类型则是支持加、减、乘、除等通用算术运算的数值数据类型。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:233
msgid "Arithmetic Promotion"
msgstr "算术类型提升"

#: ../../source/data.rst:235
msgid ""
"Binary operations can be performed on two |tile| or |scalar| operands of "
"different |numeric dtypes|."
msgstr "可以对不同 |numeric dtypes| 的两个 |tile| 或 |scalar| 操作数执行二元运算。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:237
msgid ""
"When both operands are |loosely typed numeric constants|, the result is "
"also a loosely typed constant: ``5 + 7`` is a loosely typed integral "
"constant 12, and ``5 + 3.0`` is a loosely typed floating-point constant "
"8.0."
msgstr ""
"当两个操作数均为 |loosely typed numeric constants| 时，结果同样是松散类型化常量：``5 + 7`` "
"为松散类型整数常量 12， ``5 + 3.0`` 为松散类型浮点常量 8.0。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:241
msgid ""
"If any of the operands is not a |loosely typed numeric constant|, both "
"are *promoted* to a common dtype as follows:"
msgstr ""
"只要任意操作数不是 |loosely typed numeric constant| ，二者就会按以下规则 *提升（promoted）* "
"到一个公共 dtype："

#: ../../source/data.rst:244
msgid ""
"Each operand is classified into one of the three categories: *boolean*, "
"*integral*, or *floating-point*. The categories are ordered as follows: "
"*boolean* < *integral* < *floating-point*."
msgstr ""
"每个操作数归为以下三个类别之一： *布尔（boolean）* 、 *整数（integral）* 或 *浮点（floating-point）* "
"。类别的优先级顺序为： *布尔* < *整数* < *浮点* 。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:247
msgid ""
"If either operand is a |loosely typed numeric constant|, a concrete dtype"
" is picked for it: integral constants are treated as `int32`, `int64`, or"
" `uint64`, depending on the value; floating-point constants are treated "
"as `float32`."
msgstr ""
"若某个操作数是 |loosely typed numeric constant| ，系统会根据其取值选取具体 dtype：整数常量依其大小视为 "
"``int32`` 、 ``int64`` 或 ``uint64`` ；浮点常量视为 ``float32`` 。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:250
msgid ""
"If one of the two operands has a higher category than the other, then its"
" concrete dtype is chosen as the common dtype."
msgstr "若其中一个操作数所属类别高于另一个，则选择该较高类别操作数的具体 dtype 作为公共 dtype。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:252
msgid ""
"If both operands are of the same category, but one of them is a |loosely "
"typed numeric constant|, then the other operand's dtype is picked as the "
"common dtype."
msgstr ""
"若两个操作数属于同一类别，但其中一个为 |loosely typed numeric constant| ，则选取另一个操作数的 dtype "
"作为公共 dtype。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:254
msgid "Otherwise, the common dtype is computed according to the table below."
msgstr "否则，根据下表计算二者的公共 dtype。"

