#: ../../source/data.rst:261
msgid "Tuples"
msgstr "元组"

#: ../../source/data.rst:263
msgid ""
"Tuples can be constructed and used in |tile code| and passed as |kernel| "
"arguments. Tuple arguments may be nested and contain supported argument "
"types, such as scalars and arrays. Their structure is known at compile "
"time; their elements need not be constants. Tuple indexing requires a "
"compile-time constant index."
msgstr ""
"可在 |tile code| 中构造和使用元组，也可将其作为 |kernel| "
"参数传递。元组参数可以嵌套并包含受支持的参数类型（如标量和数组）。元组的结构在编译期已知，但其元素不必全是常量。对元组进行索引需要编译期常量索引。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:269
msgid ""
"Parameter annotations can describe individual elements, for example "
"``tuple[ct.Array, ct.Constant[int]]``. A parameter annotated with "
"``ct.Constant[tuple]`` makes the whole tuple constant, so every element "
"must be representable as a compile-time constant."
msgstr ""
"参数注解可描述元组中的各个元素，例如 ``tuple[ct.Array, ct.Constant[int]]`` 。标注为 "
"``ct.Constant[tuple]`` 的参数会使整个元组变为常量，因此其所有元素都必须能表示为编译期常量。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:274
msgid ""
"For ahead-of-time export, tuple parameters use "
":py:class:`cuda.tile.compilation.TupleConstraint` and require the "
"``cutile_python_v2`` calling convention. See :ref:`compilation-callconv`."
msgstr ""
"对于预先导出（AOT），元组参数使用 :py:class:`cuda.tile.compilation.TupleConstraint` 且需要 "
"``cutile_python_v2`` 调用约定。参见 :ref:`compilation-callconv` 。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:279
msgid "Lists of Arrays"
msgstr "数组列表"

#: ../../source/data.rst:281
msgid ""
"A non-empty Python list of arrays can be passed as a kernel argument. All"
" elements must have the same rank and dtype. In |tile code|, this becomes"
" a list view supporting ``len`` and integer indexing, including runtime "
"indices. The list structure cannot be modified, but its arrays can be "
"loaded and stored. Creating or mutating ordinary Python lists in |tile "
"code| is unsupported."
msgstr ""
"可以将非空的 Python 数组列表作为内核参数传递。所有元素必须具有相同的秩（维度数）和 dtype。在 |tile code| "
"中，该列表会成为支持 ``len`` 与整数索引（包括运行时索引）的列表视图。列表结构不可更改，但可以对其中的数组执行 load 和 store "
"操作。在 |tile code| 中不支持创建或修改普通 Python 列表。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:287
msgid ""
"Use :py:class:`cuda.tile.ListAnnotation` to configure the element arrays'"
" indexing types and static dimensions."
msgstr "请使用 :py:class:`cuda.tile.ListAnnotation` 配置元素数组的索引类型及静态维度。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:293
msgid "Rounding Modes"
msgstr "舍入模式"

#: cuda.tile._numeric_semantics.RoundingMode:1 of
msgid "Rounding mode for floating-point operations."
msgstr "浮点运算的舍入模式。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RN:1 of
msgid "Round to nearest (ties to even)."
msgstr "向最接近的数舍入（半数向偶数舍入，ties to even）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RZ:1 of
msgid "Round towards zero (truncate)."
msgstr "向零舍入（截断）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RM:1 of
msgid "Round towards negative infinity."
msgstr "向负无穷大方向舍入。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RP:1 of
msgid "Round towards positive infinity."
msgstr "向正无穷大方向舍入。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RA:1 of
msgid "Round to nearest (ties away from zero)."
msgstr "向最接近的数舍入（半数远离零舍入，ties away from zero）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.FULL:1 of
msgid "Full precision rounding mode."
msgstr "全精度舍入模式。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.APPROX:1 of
msgid "Approximate rounding mode."
msgstr "近似舍入模式。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.RoundingMode.RZI:1 of
msgid "Round towards zero to the nearest integer."
msgstr "向零舍入到最接近的整数。"

#: ../../source/data.rst:303
msgid "Padding Modes"
msgstr "填充模式"

#: cuda.tile._numeric_semantics.PaddingMode:1 of
msgid "Padding mode for load operation."
msgstr "加载操作的填充模式。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.UNDETERMINED:1 of
msgid "The padding value is not determined."
msgstr "填充值未确定（undetermined）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.ZERO:1 of
msgid "The padding value is zero."
msgstr "填充值为正零（0）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.NEG_ZERO:1 of
msgid "The padding value is negative zero."
msgstr "填充值为负零（-0）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.NAN:1 of
msgid "The padding value is NaN."
msgstr "填充值为 NaN。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.POS_INF:1 of
msgid "The padding value is positive infinity."
msgstr "填充值为正无穷大（+inf）。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.PaddingMode.NEG_INF:1 of
msgid "The padding value is negative infinity."
msgstr "填充值为负无穷大（-inf）。"

